close_comment = "The Public RPC endpoints reference now lists api1 through api14 plus api-mainnet-beta at the root for HTTPS and WebSocket access. It describes the alias as a direct node endpoint, removes the beta availability restriction, and explicitly states that the former unified router is retired, matching the Public RPC documentation."
